dports (2.4.1) stable; urgency=medium

  * update: tell why a registry query failed instead of one generic
    message: rate limit, login needed (naming the registry), unreachable
    registry, timeout
  * update: report images that are not in their registry as "local". On the
    containerd image store locally built images also have a registry digest,
    so bare names missing on Docker Hub showed as "unknown"

